      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Inspired by the iconic Noé bucket bag, the Louis Vuitton Nano Frivole reimagines the signature drawstring design in a compact, elegant east-west silhouette. Crafted from Monogram canvas with VVN leather trim, it fits a phone, wallet, and other daily essentials. The adjustable, removable strap allows for hand, shoulder, or crossbody carry.",
