    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Balenciaga's Fall 2026 new Bolero bag reinterprets the classic bowling bag shape in brown vegetable-tanned lambskin. The tanning process creates a mottled, uneven texture on the leather surface, lending the bag a nostalgic, vintage feel. The architectural curved silhouette is inspired by the Bolero short jacket designed by the founder in 1937. The oval base features a diagonal zip pocket, emphasizing a natural interaction between the bag and the body.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
